{"title":"Meetily Pro 0.1.7 Release Notes | Meetily","blocks":{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"section","id":"page-intro","children":[{"type":"h1","text":"Meetily Pro 0.1.7"},{"type":"p","text":"November 26, 2025"}]},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"a","text":"Skip to main content","href":"#main"},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"h2","text":"Release Highlights"},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"text","text":"November 26, 2025"}]}]},{"type":"p","text":"Export meeting summaries to PDF, Word, and Markdown"},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"text","text":"+"}]},{"type":"text","text":"Export to PDF, Word, and Markdown"}]},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"text","text":"+"}]},{"type":"text","text":"Pro feature licensing for exports"}]},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"text","text":"+"}]},{"type":"text","text":"Enhanced summary editor"}]}]}]},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"summary","text":"Table of Contents"}]},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"h2","text":"What's New in Pro 0.1.7","id":"whats-new-in-pro-017"},{"type":"p","text":"This release introduces powerful export capabilities for your meeting summaries. Share your meeting notes with colleagues, archive them for compliance, or integrate them into your existing workflows with support for multiple file formats."},{"type":"h3","text":"Export Your Meeting Summaries","id":"export-your-meeting-summaries"},{"type":"p","text":"You can now export your meeting summaries in three popular formats:"},{"type":"ul","children":[{"type":"li","text":"PDF - Perfect for sharing with stakeholders or archiving for compliance. Creates professional, print-ready documents."},{"type":"li","text":"Word (.docx) - Ideal for further editing or incorporating into reports. Maintains formatting for seamless collaboration."},{"type":"li","text":"Markdown - Great for developers and technical teams. Easily integrate meeting notes into wikis, documentation, or version control systems."}]},{"type":"p","text":"After exporting, you will see a confirmation message with a convenient \"Open Folder\" action to quickly locate your exported file."},{"type":"h3","text":"Pro Export Features","id":"pro-export-features"},{"type":"p","text":"Export functionality is a Pro feature, indicated by the Crown icon next to export options in the interface. Pro users get access to all export formats with enhanced formatting and styling options."},{"type":"h3","text":"Enhanced Summary Editor","id":"enhanced-summary-editor"},{"type":"p","text":"The editor has been improved for a smoother editing experience when refining your meeting summaries before export or sharing."},{"type":"h3","text":"Under the Hood","id":"under-the-hood"},{"type":"ul","children":[{"type":"li","text":"Fragmented database support - Better performance for users with large meeting archives"},{"type":"li","text":"Code quality - Added pre-commit hooks to maintain consistent code standards"},{"type":"li","text":"Workflow enhancements - Improved build signing process for more reliable installations"}]},{"type":"h2","text":"Download","id":"download"},{"type":"ul","children":[{"type":"li","text":"macOS (Apple Silicon): Download .dmg\n(opens in new tab)"},{"type":"li","text":"Windows: Download .exe\n(opens in new tab)"}]}]},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Get started"}]},{"type":"h3","text":"Ready to try Meetily?"},{"type":"p","text":"Join 599,000+ users who use Meetily for private meeting transcription. No bots, privacy first. Community Edition free."},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"text","text":"No meeting bots"}]},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"text","text":"100% local transcription"}]},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Free & open source"}]}]},{"type":"div","child